"{\"title\":\"The Stars Above\",\"desc\":\"\\\"Conquer the galaxy's evils, Starfarers at your side...\\\"\\n\\n\\nJoin the Discord Server for The Stars Above!\\nDiscord Server [discord.gg]\\nThe Discord Server will be updated with the latest information pertaining to the mod, as well as previews of upcoming content!\\n\\n\\n\\n\\nGet high quality Terraria servers, modded or not, with Bisect Hosting!\\nUse the promo code \\\"starsabove\\\" to get 25% off your first month- and help support me as well! Thank you!\\nBisect Hosting [www.bisecthosting.com] ➔ Game Servers ➔ Terraria\\n\\n\\nThe Stars Above is a Terraria expansion mod that adds a wide variety of content and a new important game mechanic:\\nthe Starfarer system. The Stars Above guarantees a unique experience for any playthrough with new bosses, new areas to explore, and a focus on buildcrafting and player diversity.\\n\\n\\nA brief overview of the mod's features:\\n\\nFull Multiplayer support\\n\\nTwo fully furnished deuteroganists with over 1000+ lines of dialogue and custom UI\\n\\nModular, upgradable ultimate abilities that scale with boss progression\\n\\nUpgrade weapons with tons of interesting and varied collectible items for even more build diversity\\n\\nAbility to explore unique premade locations throughout the galaxy with help from Subworld Library\\n\\n24 custom unlockable passive abilities present in a unique weight-based system\\n\\n80+ special unique weapons that have malleable damage types, alternate abilities, charged attacks, etc.\\n\\nUnique pre-rendered cutscenes for certain events and abilities\\n\\n9 unique bosses each with their own special cast-centric AI\\n\\nPlenty of pets, accessories, and utility items\\n\\nSettings to tailor the mod's content to your liking\\n\\nCompatibility with 100% of major content mods (sometimes with unique dialogue)\\n\\nAnd much more!\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\nSTARFARERS\\n\\nThe Stars Above's flagship feature: Meet Asphodene and Eridani, masters of Astral and Umbral respectively.\\nEmpowered by their strength and led by their guidance, you will be able to challenge any foe Terraria has to offer. These charismatic deuteragonists boast tons of unique dialogue for bosses, biomes, and more. (However, if you don't care for it, most dialogue can be disabled in the Mod Settings!)\\nAs of v2.1, enjoy over 100+ voice lines by Kiera Rhodes, giving life to the Starfarer's conversations!\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\nWEAPONS\\n\\nObtain extraordinary weapons with layers of strategy and myriad powers to overwhelm your foes. Weapons are incredibly unique and can be adjusted to any damage class- including features such as charged attacks, timed counters, energy gauges, and more. Brandish beloved weapons from your favorite game franchises re-imagined into the world of Terraria.\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\nSTELLAR ARRAY\\n\\nMaster the Stellar Array, a powerful supplement to player growth.\\nWith 24 powerful passive abilities separated into 3 distinct tiers, you can mix and match to become the strongest Terrarian- buildcraft and skill expression tailored to any playthrough.\\nYour Starfarer has influence on what abilities you have available!\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\nBOSSES\\n\\nDefeat nine powerful unique bosses boasting a custom AI system:\\nCasted Attacks. Adapt and learn to defeat these formidable enemies!\\n\\nFace off against the Vagrant of Space and Time, Penthesilea, the Witch of Ink, the Warrior of Light, and much more!\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\nWEAPON MEMORIES\\n\\nA new system added in The Stars Above v2.0, Weapon Memories are unique items obtained throughout game progression that can be slotted into Aspected Weapons. Give weapons Summon Tag Damage, gain buffs when killing foes, cause lightning to strike from your attacks, gain active abilities to change the tide of battle, and much more!\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\nTHE NEON VEIL\\n\\nExplore a brand new biome in the Underworld complete with new unique loot, armor, and foes. The shining towers of the Neon Veil provide an incredibly unique new environment to explore- and a way to upgrade your Stellar Novas with unique set bonuses for even more buildcraft potential.\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\nCOSMIC VOYAGES\\n\\nExplore the Moirae Galaxy through a brand-new system added in The Stars Above: Celestial Cartography. With the help of Subworld Library, obtain rare materials, powerful accessories, and more.\\n\\nAs of tModLoader 1.4.4, multiplayer Subworld transit is now possible!\\nKeep in mind that there may still be issues with the system; if you do encounter said issues, you can enable Multiplayer Compatbility Mode in the Serverside Settings to revert to the old system.\\n\\n\\n\\n\\nADDITIONAL CONTENT / MOD CROSSOVER CONTENT\\n\\nThe features of The Stars Above doesn't stop here; express yourself with unique pets o\",\"stats\":\"851.097 MB | 2 Aug, 2021 @ 7:16am | 1 Apr @ 5:24am\",\"tags\":\"\"}"
